"entity": {
"name": "Grafton Group PLC",
"description": "Grafton Group Plc engages in the distribution of construction products. It operates through the following geographical segments: Island of Ireland, Great Britain, Northern Europe, and Iberia. The Island of Ireland geographical segment includes Chadwicks, Woodie\u2019s, MacBlair, and MFP. The Great Britain geographical segment comprises Selco, Leyland SDM, TG Lynes, CPI EuroMix, and StairBox. The Northern Europe geographical segment focuses on the Isero and Polvo in The Netherlands and IKH in Finland. The Iberia geographical segment includes Salvador Escoda in Spain. The company was founded by William Thomas Chadwick in 1902 and is headquartered in Dublin, Ireland.",
